PATCH {{base}}/departments/<department-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Computer Science & Engineering"
}

### Courses — list / create (super_admin, college_admin)
GET {{base}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

