### Enrollments — list (admin) / self-enroll (student)
GET {{base}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enrollments — enroll self
POST {{base}}/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "<course-id>",
  "subject": "<subject-id>"
}

### Enrollments — drop self
DELETE {{base}}/enrollments/me/<enrollment-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assignments — list / detail (populated submissions → student)
GET {{base}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assignments — create (super_admin, college_admin, faculty, hod)
POST {{base}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "<subject-id>",
  "title": "Assignment 1",
  "instructions": "Solve all problems",
  "maxMarks": 100,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31"
}

### Assignments — status transition
PATCH {{base}}/assignments/<assignment-id>/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "published"
}

### Submissions — list (faculty, hod, student, admins)
GET {{base}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submissions — create (student; file-upload variant in submissions.http)
POST {{base}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignment": "<assignment-id>",
  "content": "https://example.com/my-work"
}

### Submissions — grade (faculty, hod; allowlisted marks/grade)
PATCH {{base}}/submissions/<submission-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marks": 85,
  "grade": "A"
}

### Attendance — list sessions
GET {{base}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Attendance — mark session (faculty, hod; realtime broadcast)
POST {{base}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "<subject-id>",
  "date": "2026-09-25",
  "records": [{ "student": "<student-id>", "status": "present" }]
}

### Attendance — student view
GET {{base}}/attendance/student/<student-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

